      "section": "Customer self-repair (CSR) A parts and accessories",
      "content": "Customer self-repair (CSR) A parts and accessories",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0105",
      "reading_order": 115,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/0",
      "content": "Customer self-repair (CSR) A parts are parts that a customer replaces without assistance from a field technician. These parts can be replaced without the use of any tools."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0106",
      "reading_order": 116,
      "section": "Removal and replacement: Toner cartridge",
      "content": "Removal and replacement: Toner cartridge",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0107",
      "reading_order": 117,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/3",
      "content": "Learn how to remove and replace the toner cartridge."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0108",
      "reading_order": 118,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/3",
      "content": "To view a short video of this procedure, click the link below."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0109",
      "reading_order": 119,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/3",
      "content": "View a video of how to remove and replace the toner cartridge."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0110",
      "reading_order": 120,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/3",
      "content": "Mean time to repair: 5 minutes"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0111",
      "reading_order": 121,
      "section": "/page/20/SectionHeader/3",
      "content": "Service level: CSR A"
    },
    {
